  "description": "OmniGeo is a multimodal large language model (MLLM) tailored for geospatial artificial intelligence (GeoAI), capable of processing and analyzing heterogeneous data sources including satellite imagery, geospatial metadata, and textual descriptions. It covers five core GeoAI tasks: health geography, urban geography, remote sensing, urban perception, and geospatial semantics.",
